+       three horizontal bars and two side bumps forming a blocky B), cut
+       from the circle in one compound path via fill-rule="evenodd".
+       No mask element (see badge-a.svg for why). -->
+  <path fill-rule="evenodd" fill="#ffffff" d="
+    M 8,1 A 7,7 0 1,0 8,15 A 7,7 0 1,0 8,1 Z
+    M 5.4,4 L 6.6,4 L 6.6,12 L 5.4,12 Z
